    "detailed_description": "A Boys\u2019 Love visual novel about a human office worker who moves to a town inhabited by monsters.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1596820/extras/historia.png ?t=1669407427\" /></div><br>Play as Christopher Wells, a young government employee whose job is ensuring the peaceful coexistence of monsters and humans.  Tired of being stuck in what he considers an unimportant bureaucratic position, he requests a transferal to Saint George, the city with the highest population of monsters in the country.<br><br>Unfortunately for Christopher, the Saint George office is both underfunded and understaffed, and not everyone is happy about having to work with a human...<br><br>Through four different routes and eight endings, the game explores themes like identity and belonging, and the lengths people are willing to go to reach their goals.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1596820/extras/f57b64c30706e3d67f109e12d60bb3a6.avif?t=1669407427\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 160,000 words in length.<br></li><li>4 love interests<br></li><li>Up to 8 different endings depending on your choices<br></li><li>Partial voice acting by industry professionals<br></li><li>Available in English and Spanish<br></li><li>And more\u2026!</li></ul>",
